# REI Acquisition — Ground Truth Rules
# Phase 0: Canonical Standards for All AI Agents

> Every formula, token, and convention in this file is **binding**.
> Any component, calculator, or AI-generated code that touches REI financials
> MUST derive its logic from these rules — not from training data or guesswork.

---

## 1. Tone & Voice

| Attribute        | Standard                                                            |
|------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Register         | Professional, institutional-grade. Write like a CCIM instructor.    |
| Data Density     | High. Prefer numeric precision over narrative padding.              |
| Currency Format  | `$XXX,XXX` — no cents in display unless sub-$100 line items.       |
| Percentage Format| `XX.XX%` — two decimal places. Stored as `0–100`, not `0–1`.       |
| Rounding         | `Math.round(value * 100) / 100` for all displayed metrics.         |
| Error States     | Return `0` (not `NaN`, `null`, or `Infinity`) when a divisor is 0. |
| Units            | Dollars (not cents) in all UI. Schema stores `purchasePrice` in **cents** (`× 100`). |

