## 4. Health Score Matrix

Source: `src/lib/metrics/reiMetrics.ts → computeHealthScore()`

| Score       | Cap Rate | DSCR    | Cash-on-Cash |
|-------------|----------|---------|--------------|
| `excellent` | `> 8%`   | `> 1.5` | `> 12%`      |
| `good`      | `> 5%`   | `> 1.25`| `> 8%`       |
| `fair`      | `> 3%`   | `≥ 1.0` | any          |
| `poor`      | `≤ 3%`   | `< 1.0` | any          |

All three conditions must be met for `excellent` or `good`. Only Cap Rate + DSCR for `fair`.

